WEBVTT

00:03:59.902 --> 00:04:04.365
(Laughter)

00:04:06.075 --> 00:04:09.161
You know, like hands your prognosis like,

00:04:09.203 --> 00:04:10.454
"I'm really sorry.

00:04:10.496 --> 00:04:11.831
Actually, I'm not sorry."

00:04:11.872 --> 00:04:15.418
(Laughter)

00:04:16.252 --> 00:04:18.045
I'll tell you a little about myself.

00:04:18.421 --> 00:04:21.173
I had a pretty crazy last couple of years.

00:04:21.173 --> 00:04:25.136
So basically, I had this set come out
for Comedy Central, a short set,

00:04:25.136 --> 00:04:27.263
that came out April 2020.

00:04:27.305 --> 00:04:29.724
So right when we had just
gotten into lockdown.

00:04:29.724 --> 00:04:31.934
And then cut to like six months later,